1
00:00:00,350 --> 00:00:06,780
A prisoner gets one last chance to escape. There are three doors. Behind the first is a raging fire.

2
00:00:07,080 --> 00:00:13,785
Behind the second, assassins with sharp swords. Behind the third, lions that haven't eaten in three years.

3
00:00:14,085 --> 00:00:17,287
Which door is the safest? You have 10 seconds. Think!

4
00:00:26,087 --> 00:00:26,994
The third door!

5
00:00:27,294 --> 00:00:32,317
Lions that haven't eaten in three years would have starved long ago. The room is safe.

6
00:00:32,617 --> 00:00:35,703
Did you get it right? Follow for a new riddle every day!
